's State Quarter, featuring the mustang","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A2006_NV_Proof.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Mustangs.jpg/500px-Mustangs.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Mustangs.jpg/500px-Mustangs.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Mustangs running free on a range located within BLM-managed land","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMustangs.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/My_Public_Lands_Roadtrip-_Idaho_4H-Wild_Horse_and_Burro_Partnership_%2818616217428%29.jpg/500px-My_Public_Lands_Roadtrip-_Idaho_4H-Wild_Horse_and_Burro_Partnership_%2818616217428%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/My_Public_Lands_Roadtrip-_Idaho_4H-Wild_Horse_and_Burro_Partnership_%2818616217428%29.jpg/1280px-My_Public_Lands_Roadtrip-_Idaho_4H-Wild_Horse_and_Burro_Partnership_%2818616217428%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/My_Public_Lands_Roadtrip-_Idaho_4H-Wild_Horse_and_Burro_Partnership_%2818616217428%29.jpg/500px-My_Public_Lands_Roadtrip-_Idaho_4H-Wild_Horse_and_Burro_Partnership_%2818616217428%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Wild Mustang Project in Idaho is a project of 4-H and BLM to help increase adoption rates of mustangs.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMy_Public_Lands_Roadtrip-_Idaho_4H-Wild_Horse_and_Burro_Partnership_(18616217428).jpg"}],"sounds":{"spanish":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3a/En-us-Spanish.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original